&lt;p style="margin-left: 228px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;株式会社メルペイ　　　（１）売上高　　　31,195百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 228px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;（２）経常利益　　 3,041百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 228px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;（３）当期純利益　 6,422百万円&lt;/p&gt;
