&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 120px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -36px"&gt;２．地域ごとの情報&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 108px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;（１）売上高&lt;/p&gt;
